<title>FRANCE: Credit Agricole cuts base rate.</title>
<headline>Credit Agricole cuts base rate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Credit Agricole said on Friday it was cutting its base rate to 6.55 percent from 6.75 effective Monday.</p>
<p>The move followed announcements from other leading French commercial banks, which cut rates by the same amount.</p>
<p>The Bank of France on Thursday reduce the key intervention rate to 3.25 percent from 3.35.</p>
</text>
